process.rule:
1. Read github-branch from task.xml. Verify current branch matches. If not, error and exit. 2. Commit and push: git add .festinalente/tasks/{id}/plan.xml .festinalente/tasks/{id}/task.xml git commit -m "docs({id}): plan - {title}" git push 3. Comment on GitHub Issue with full plan: mcp__GitHub__add_issue_comment — body: "## Planned

```xml
{plan.xml contents}
```" 4. Create Draft PR: mcp__GitHub__create_pull_request — title: "{title}", head: {github-branch}, base: main, draft: true, body: "Closes #{github-issue}

_Draft — not yet implemented._" 5. Add github-pr="#{N}" to task.xml, commit and push: git commit -m "docs({id}): draft pr created - {title}" && git push
